            "speakerName": "月灵",
            "text": "~！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761250231"
            ]
          },
          "761250231": {
            "id": "761250231",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这只月灵…似乎是喜欢弹琴的那只。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761250232"
            ]
          },
          "761250232": {
            "id": "761250232",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这只月灵…有点心神不宁的样子呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761250233"
            ]
          },
          "761250233": {
            "id": "761250233",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "要不你弹点什么吧？听到熟悉的旋律，说不定就可以稍稍安下心来…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761250234"
            ]
          },
          "761250234": {
            "id": "761250234",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "熟悉的旋律…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761250235"
